## 5. Recommended Architecture

The recommended architecture separates desktop classes by operational profile and risk posture.

```text
                     Active Directory / Entra ID
                                  │
                    ┌─────────┴──────────┐
                    ▼                    ▼
       [OU: VMware_DevQA]     [OU: Azure_Consultants]
                    │                    │
       • Loopback: Replace     • Loopback: Replace
       • Files On-Demand: Yes  • Files On-Demand: Yes
       • Storage Sense: 30d     • Storage Sense: 3d
       • User override: Yes     • User override: No
       • Personal sync: Yes    • Personal sync: No
```

This pattern is a practical example of workload-aware policy design. It acknowledges that not all endpoint classes should receive the same storage and security posture.

