## 6. Environmental Matrix

The following matrix is a recommended default model for enterprise workloads.

| Strategy Dimension | VMware VDI (Prod / Dev / QA) | Azure Hybrid VMs (Consultants / Restricted Users) |
|---|---|---|
| Primary Workload | Software build, validation, QA, engineering tasks | Documentation, testing, advisory, support work |
| Files On-Demand | Enabled | Enabled |
| User Override | Allowed for approved groups | Blocked |
| Storage Sense Trigger | 30 days | 3 days |
| Personal Sync | Allowed, if permitted by policy | Blocked |
| Tenant Boundary | Internal tenant only | Internal tenant only + personal sync disabled |
| Storage Goal | Productivity + moderate cost control | Aggressive cost containment and risk reduction |

This is not intended as a universal standard. It should be used as a baseline and adjusted to align with business policy and operational requirements.

