## 7.2 Profile Storage Optimization

Where FSLogix is used to manage profile containers, storage compaction should be enabled as a secondary optimization control.

### PowerShell: FSLogix Compaction Setting

```powershell
<#
.SYNOPSIS
    SOP Step: Enable FSLogix VHD compaction support
#>

$FSLogixPath = "HKLM:\SOFTWARE\FSLogix\Apps"

if (-not (Test-Path $FSLogixPath)) {
    New-Item -Path $FSLogixPath -Force | Out-Null
}

Set-ItemProperty -Path $FSLogixPath -Name "VHDCompactDisk" -Value 1 -PropertyType DWord -Force
```

This step supports the reduction of stale or fragmented profile content but should not be treated as a replacement for OneDrive policy enforcement.

